Third-party material
--------------------
This skill contains no third-party code and redistributes no third-party files.

Its guidance describes the observable behaviour of SAP-provided ABAP test
isolation frameworks (cl_osql_test_environment, cl_cds_test_environment,
cl_aunit_authority_check, cl_function_test_environment, cl_amdp_test_environment,
and the cl_botd_* RAP business object test environments) and follows conventions
set out in the Clean ABAP style guide published by SAP SE. All such material is
described in the authors' own words; no documentation text is reproduced.

